From: Ventuno integration <ventuno@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] pvcontrol: prefer curl when the full client is installed

Use curl's independent request handling for concurrent administration, keeping
the minimal pvcurl fallback for initramfs environments without curl. Explicit
CURL_CMD overrides remain supported.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
diff --git a/tools/pvcontrol b/tools/pvcontrol
--- a/tools/pvcontrol
+++ b/tools/pvcontrol
@@ -14,7 +14,13 @@ response=''
 signal=''
 daemon_name=''
 
-CURL_CMD=${CURL_CMD:-pvcurl}
+if [ -z "$CURL_CMD" ]; then
+	if command -v curl >/dev/null 2>&1; then
+		CURL_CMD=curl
+	else
+		CURL_CMD=pvcurl
+	fi
+fi
 
 if ! command -v $CURL_CMD >/dev/null 2>&1; then
 	CURL_CMD="curl"
